Subj: Colossal Cave: say the magic word
Date: 09-04-88 19:55

The granddaddy of them all, Colossal Cave Adventure, came with my
ARM/AT on the hard disk, in C:\GAMES\ADVENT.  If yours didn't, ask at
SFARM, somebody will have it on the disk-of-the-month.

Hint for beginners: there's a building near the start.  Go inside.
Look around.  Read everything carefully, especially anything that looks
like it's written on a wall.  Then say XYZZY.

Then try saying it somewhere else, and enjoy the most famous two words
in computer games:  "Nothing happens."

Lenny
