From: Bill Tran
To: All
Subj: RISC Wars: some tips for new pilots
Date: 02-20-90 03:10

RISC Wars has eaten my week.  Things I've learned the expensive way:

  * Find two ports next to each other that want each other's cargo.
    Fly back and forth.  That's the whole secret of every trading game
    ever made, and it's still true in space.
  * Buy more cargo holds as soon as you can afford them.  Every trip
    earns more.
  * Fighters are insurance.  Don't fly into a strange sector with none.
  * Watch the news.  Some of the other pilots are VERY busy at 4 AM.
    Nobody I know is awake at 4 AM.  Except me.  And them.

Bill
